{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.chiyoko.gift",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "收工后她叫住我",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.chiyoko.gift",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.chiyoko.gift",
    "idolId": "chiyoko",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "大家，辛苦了——！",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "智代子，辛苦了。",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "制作人先生！辛苦了！",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "今天是临时的工作，不过……很开心呢！",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，甜品联动以外的工作也顺利多起来了。",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "是！能做各种工作，很开心！",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "不过……果然我的原点还是在巧克力。",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "像这样离巧克力越来越远，有点寂寞……诶嘿嘿。",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "感觉像……想家一样。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊……那下次也去接一些巧克力偶像的工作。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "诶？真的吗！？",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "哇——！约好了哦，制作人先生！绝对哦！",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不过，别的工作也要好好做？",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "当然！不管什么工作我都会全力努力！",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那就好。看这状态，应该不用担心了。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "诶嘿嘿……！……啊，对了！",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "怎么了？",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "其实本来打算今天马上给您的，结果因为工作完全忘了！",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "……给！制作人先生，这是我送您的礼物。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "当然是巧克力！这个非常好吃，但很受欢迎，很难买到！",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这么好味的巧克力，给我？我很高兴，不过为什么？",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "那是因为……诶嘿嘿。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "……我觉得，我一直没能好好道谢。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "一直带着我，把我拉到最前面的制作人先生。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "我想把平时的感谢，用礼物表达出来！",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哪里，我才要……谢谢你，智代子。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "不会不会！……这种事，说出来还是有点不好意思。",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "制作人先生，今后也请多多指教園田智代子！",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "当然。请多指教，智代子。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "哇！？制、制作人先生，刚才那是……！",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "说起来，我今天一整天工作，什么都没吃。",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "唔……是的……",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……好！我也受了智代子不少照顾，就当巧克力的回礼，今天我请客！",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "诶！可、可是，巧克力本来就是我感谢的心意……！",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "别客气，我想让智代子尽情地吃。",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "……是！谢谢您！",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "这么多……！从哪个开始吃……",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "从哪个都行，从智代子喜欢的开始就好。",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "那……我要特大的巧克力芭菲！我开动了！",
        "nextNodeId": "40"
      },
      "40": {
        "id": "40",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "喂喂，不用从甜点开始吧……！——听不到了啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "41"
      },
      "41": {
        "id": "41",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "嗯——！！好吃！果然巧克力最棒了！",
        "nextNodeId": "42"
      },
      "42": {
        "id": "42",
        "speakerId": "chiyoko",
        "text": "被喜欢的东西围着……！我现在非常幸福哦，制作人先生！"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
